        <IRI>Campus</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">A university campus is considered a location, typically identified by a name that often matches the name of the city in which it is situated. It is not a general rule, for instance, the UFPR has several campus at Curitiba: Histórico, Juvevê, etc.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
